-----------------------------Fortinet Firewall- --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
get system interface physical 
get system interface physical port1
diagnose hardware sysinfo conserve          to check hardware info

To configure interfaces
#config system interface
Fortigate(interface)# show         To see all interfaces
Fortigate(interface)# edit port1
Fortigate(port1)# set mode static    to set as static from dynmic
Fortigate(port1)# set ip 172.16.5.19 255.255.255.0

----------------------------------------------------Ping------------------------------------------------------------
Set the source IP/interface:
#execute ping-options source 172.16.5.215
#execute ping 172.16.5.16

Set the number of ping packets:
#execute ping-options repeat-count 5

Set packet size
execute ping-options data-size 1400


View current ping options:
#execute ping-options view-settings

Reset ping options to default:
#execute ping-options reset

---------------------------------Routing-----------------------------------------------
#get router info routing-table all                          To see routing table


