-----------------------Fortianalyzer logging------------------------------------------------
Reliable loggin and OFTPS

#config log fortianalyzer setting
set status enable
set enc-algorithm [high-med | high | low ]
set reliable enable 
end

---------------------------------------View logs in CLI--------------------------------
